The login/logout controls are contained within the `userlinks` block of the `rest_framework/base.html` template. When you override this block in your custom `rest_framework/api.html` template without including the original content, the default login/logout links are removed.

To preserve the authentication links while adding your own, you must use `{{ block.super }}` within the `userlinks` block in your custom template:

```html
{% extends "rest_framework/base.html" %}

{% block userlinks %}
    {{ block.super }}
    <!-- Add your additional links here -->
{% endblock %}
```

